c6af4d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- The 2023-10-19 conversation continued: Calvin announced he's actually going to Tokyo in November 2023 (\"next month\") after the tour ends, sharing a photo of a city at night with a tall building in the background — \"Sometimes I wish I could go back to places like [that]. What a great view!\"; Dave: \"Wow, Calvin! That's great to hear!\" and asked any specific spots in Tokyo he's really excited to check out; Calvin: Shibuya Crossing — \"like Tokyo's Times Square\" — and he's \"excited to explore Shinjuku,\" plus \"amazing food there, can't wait to try it again!\" — sharing a photo of Shibuya Crossing at night (a crowd of people with umbrellas in the rain) — \"that's amazing!\"; Dave: \"Shibuya and Shinjuku are cool spots! The food in Tokyo is great, I'll have so much fun exploring all the different places.\" and asked whether Calvin has tried ramen, sharing a photo of a bowl of ramen (a bowl of soup with broccoli and noodles) he tried in Boston — \"it was delicious, but I think in Tokyo it will be even better!\"; Calvin: never tried ramen, but \"it's supposed to be awesome\" — \"Gonna give it a shot while in Tokyo!\"; Dave: \"Do it, Calvin! Once you try it, you'll never go back. Bon voyage and have fun!\"; the chat closed with Calvin: \"Thanks, Dave! I'll definitely give it a shot. Appreciate the encouragement! See you soon, bye!\" (Tokyo trip details in ## Tokyo trip (2023-04-20); Dave's side in the 2023-10-19 entry of the Relationships section and the Japan section of /memories/dave.md) [S24T17][S24T18][S24T19][S24T20][S24T21][S24T22][S24T23].","text_sha256":"72d66c837d158fafc3c8badb27d337cc5fa51d3ca7298529271072f8f70d02f3","timestamp":"2023-10-19T10:11:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"98109144a5a23da7a5b89634be2c543ea2366f2abe85f1f3f8a3df64a5e92ce2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D24:20","D24:22"],"kind":"curated_fact","line_end":109,"line_start":109,"source_locators":["[S24T20]","[S24T22]"],"text_sha256":"f2d9178a0bc095c89b35